README for computing/bin/fsm

This directory contains a script to convert output from the Racket
Finite State machine simulator

  computing/src/automata/scheme/finite-state-machine.rkt

to an input file for Asymptote.

An example of output from the simulator is in fsmout.test.  So to
produce the Asymptote input file run this

  ./fsm_to_asy.py -f fsmout.test

The result will be fsm.asy.  Run it through Asymptote with

  asy -nosafe fsm.asy

and it will produce a sequence of .pdf files that show the steps of the
Finite State machine.